		<!DOCTYPE html>
		<!-- saved from url=(0060)https://acervofundiario.incra.gov.br/acervo/login.php -->
		<html lang="pt-BR"><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
			<meta charset="utf-8"/>
			<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
			<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
			<title>Certificação - Login</title>
			<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/">
			<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com/" crossorigin="">
			<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/">
			<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com/" crossorigin="">
			<link href="./Acervo - Login_files/css2" rel="stylesheet">
			<link href="./Acervo - Login_files/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-KK94CHFLLe+nY2dmCWGMq91rCGa5gtU4mk92HdvYe+M/SXH301p5ILy+dN9+nJOZ" crossorigin="anonymous">
			<style>
				*{
					margin: 0;
					padding: 0;
					box-sizing: border-box;
				}
				:root{
					--green1: #219653;
					--green2: #52AB79;
					--green3: #83C09F;
					--green4: #B4D5C5;
					--orange1: #FFBA41;
					--orange2: #F9C66C;
					--black: #000000;
					--black2: #393A3B;
					--black3: #727476;
					--black4: #ABAEB1;
					--white: #ffffff;
					--white0: #fafafa;
					--white1: #E5E9EB;
					--blue1: #236BB7;
					--blue2: #548BC4;
					--bluex: #1c5692;
				}
				body{
					width: 100%;
					height: 100vh;
					font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
					background: url('bg_incra.webp') repeat-x left center fixed;
					color: var(--black2);
				}
				.main{
					width: 100%;
					height: 100%;
					display: flex;
					flex-direction: column;
					justify-content: space-between;
				}
				.header{
					width: 100%;
					height: 70px;
					background-color: var(--green1);
					display: flex;
					align-items: center;
					padding: 30px;
					gap:20px;
				}
				.logo-img{
					width: 43px;
				}
				.header h2{
					font-size: 1.4rem;
					font-weight: 700;
					margin-bottom: 0;
					color: var(--dark5);
				}
				.logo-text{
					display: flex;
					flex-direction: column;
					justify-content: center;
					align-items: flex-start;
					color: var(--white);
				}
				.content{
					width: 100%;
					height: 100%;
					padding: 30px;
					display: flex;
					justify-content: center;
					align-items: center;
					background: radial-gradient(at left top, rgba(33, 150, 83, .4), rgba(0, 0, 0, .75));
				}
				.box-login{
					width: 100%;
					height: 100%;
					border-radius: 4px;
					display: flex;
					justify-content: center;
					align-items: flex-start;
					gap: 60px;
				}
				.b-title-sub-link{
					display: flex;
					flex-direction: column;
					justify-content: center;
					height: 100%;
				}
				.box-title-btn{
					height: 100%;
					text-align: center;
				}
				.box-title-btn, .box-text{
					width: 100%;
				}
				.box-text{
					display: flex;
					flex-direction: column;
					align-self: center;
				}
				.box-text .external-link{
					color: var(--orange2);
					text-decoration: none;
					font-weight: 600;
				}
				.box-text .external-link:hover{
					color: var(--orange1);
				}
				.box-login h1{
					font-size: 4.2rem;
					font-weight: 900;
					line-height: 4.2rem;
					letter-spacing: 0.05rem;
					color: var(--white);
					margin:0 0 30px;
					text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
				}
				.box-login h1 span{
					color: var(--orange1);
				}
				.box-login h2,
				.box-login p{
					text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
					color: var(--white0);
				}
				.box-login h2{
					font-size: 1.6rem;
					font-weight: 500;
					letter-spacing: 0.05rem;
					margin: 0 0 30px;
					color: var(--white1);
				}
				.box-login p{
					font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
					font-size: 1.5rem;
					font-weight: 300;
					line-height: 1.6rem;
					text-align: justify;
					margin: 0 0 18px;
				}
				.btn-gov{
					width: 100%;
					max-width: 300px;
					height: 50px;
					background-color: var(--blue1);
					border-radius: 5px;
					display: flex;
					justify-content: center;
					align-items: center;
					text-decoration: none;
					color: var(--white);
					font-size: 1.1rem;
					font-weight: 500;
					transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out;
					margin: 0 auto;
				}
				.btn-gov:hover{
					background-color: var(--bluex);
				}
				.btn-gov span{
					font-weight: 700;
					margin-left: 5px;
				}
				.btn-mobile{
					display: none!important;
				}
				.Footer{
					width: 100%;
					height: auto;
					background-color: var(--black2);
					display: flex;
					justify-content: space-between;
					align-items: center;
					padding: 0 30px;
					gap:10px;
					position: relative;
					color: var(--black4);
				}
				.Footer h3{
					color: var(--white);
					font-size: 1.3rem;
					margin: 0;
				}
				.Footer p{
					font-size: 0.85rem;
					font-weight: 400;
					margin: 0;
				}
				.Footer .btn-link{
					color: var(--black4);
					font-weight: 600;
					text-decoration: none;
					background: transparent;
					border: none;
					padding: 14px 5px;
					transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out;
				}
				.Footer .btn-link:hover{
					background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .04);
				}
				.logo-footer{
					width: 100%;
					max-width: 100px;
					height: auto;
					display: flex;
					justify-content: center;
					align-items: center;
					gap: 10px;
				}
				.modal-content{
					border-radius: 4px;
				}
				.modal-body{
					padding: 1.3rem;
				}
				.modal h4{
					margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
				}
				.modal .btn{
					text-decoration: none;
					color: var(--black2);
					font-size: 0.9rem;
					font-weight: 500;
					padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
					border: none!important;
					border-radius: 4px;
				}
				.modal .btn:hover{
					background: var(--white1);
				}
				.modal .btn:active{
					border: none!important;
				}
				@media(max-width:991px){
					.box-login h1{
						font-size: 3.2rem;
						line-height: 3.2rem;
					}
					.box-login h2{
						font-size: 1.3rem;
					}
					.box-login p{
						font-size: 1.1rem;
						line-height: 1.3rem;
					}
				}
				@media(max-width:767px){
					.header{
						padding: 20px;
					}
					.header h2{
						font-size: 1.2rem;
					}
					.box-login h1{
						font-size: 2.8rem;
						line-height: 2.8rem;
					}
					.box-login h2{
						font-size: 1.2rem;
					}
					.box-login p{
						font-size: 1.05rem;
						line-height: 1.2rem;
					}
					.modal-body{
						padding: 1rem;
					}
					.modal h4{
						margin: 0 0 1rem;
					}
					.modal p{
						font-size: 0.9rem;
						line-height: 1.1rem;
					}
					.modal ul{
						font-size: 0.9rem;
						line-height: 1.1rem;
					}
					.modal .btn{
						font-size: 0.8rem;
						padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
					}

				}
				@media(max-width:600px){
					body{
						height: auto;
					}
					.header{
						padding: 10px;
					}
					.header h2{
						font-size: 1.1rem;
					}
					.box-login{
						flex-direction: column;
						gap: 0;
					}
					.box-login h1{
						font-size: 2.3rem;
						line-height: 2.3rem;
					}
					.box-login h2{
						font-size: 1.1rem;
					}
					.box-login p{
						font-size: 1rem;
						line-height: 1.1rem;
					}
					.box-login .btn-gov{
						display: none;
					}
					.box-login a span{
						font-weight: 700;
						margin-left: 5px;
					}
					.b-title-sub-link .btn{
						display: none;
					}
					.box-text .btn-gov{
						display: flex!important;
						margin-top: 12px;
					}
					.Footer{
						padding: 10px;
						flex-direction: column;
						gap: 5px;
					}
					.Footer h3{
						font-size: 0.9rem;
					}
					.Footer p{
						font-size: 0.8rem;
					}
					.Footer .btn-link{
						font-size: 0.8rem;
						padding: 0 5px;
					}
					.modal-body h4{
						font-size: 1rem;
						line-height: 1.2rem;
					}
					.modal-body p{
						font-size: 0.8rem;
						line-height: 1rem;
					}
					.modal-body ul{
						font-size: 0.8rem;
						line-height: 1rem;
					}
					.modal .btn{
						font-size: 0.7rem;
						padding: 0.5rem 0.8rem;
					}

				}
			</style>
			<script>
				function addcooki() {
					// Adicione aqui a lógica para remover os cookies
					// Pode ser uma chamada AJAX para o servidor ou manipulação local do cookie
					// Exemplo de manipulação local (considerando cookies simples):
					document.cookie = "dtCookie=; expires=Thu, 01 Jan 2999 00:00:00 GMT; path=/";
				}
			</script>
		</head>
		<body>
			<div class="main">
				<section class="header">
					<img class="logo-img" src="https://acervofundiario.incra.gov.br/acervo/logo-incra.png" alt="Certifica&ccedil" title="Certifica&ccedil">
					<div class="logo-text">
						<h2>Certifica&ccedil;&atilde;o</h2>
					</div>
				</section>
				<section class="content">
					<div class="box-login">
						<div class="box-title-btn">
							<div class="b-title-sub-link">
								<div class="title">
									<h1>O acesso ao <span>Certifica&ccedil;&atilde;o</span> mudou,</h1>
									<h2>mas as informa&ccedil;&otilde;es continuam no formato que voc&ecirc; utilizava antes.</h2>
								</div>
								<div class="btn">
									<a class="btn-gov" href="https://sso.acesso.gov.br/authorize?client_id=certificacao.incra.gov.br&redirect_uri=https://certificacao.incra.gov.br/csv_shp/export_shp.py&response_type=code&scope=openid+email+phone+profile+govbr_confiabilidades" title="Entrar com GOV.BR" onclick="addcooki()">Entrar com <span>GOV.BR</span></a>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="box-text">
							<p>Para acess&aacute;-lo, &eacute; necess&aacute;rio autenticar com a credencial do <a class="external-link" href="https://www.gov.br/governodigital/pt-br/conta-gov-br">gov.br</a>, dispon&iacute;vel para qualquer cidad&atilde;o, e que tamb&eacute;m &eacute; usada nos demais servi&ccedil;os digitais do Governo Federal.</p>
							<p>A estrutura das informa&ccedil;&otilde;es continua da forma que voc&ecirc; acessava antes, sejam elas relativas &agrave;s &aacute;reas certificadas (SIGEF e SNCI), assentamentos de reforma agr&aacute;ria, territ&oacute;rios quilombolas, entre outras bases de dados fornecidas pelo Incra dentro da pol&iacute;tica de dados abertos.</p>
							<a class="btn-gov btn-mobile" href="https://sso.acesso.gov.br/authorize?client_id=certificacao.incra.gov.br&redirect_uri=https://certificacao.incra.gov.br/csv_shp/export_shp.py&response_type=code&scope=openid+email+phone+profile+govbr_confiabilidades" title="Entrar com GOV.BR">Entrar com <span>GOV.BR</span></a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</section>
				<footer class="Footer">	
					<p>Todos os direitos Reservados © Copyright 2024 - INCRA | <button class="btn-link" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#contato">Contato</button> | <button class="btn-link" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#sobre">Sobre</button></p>
					<div class="logo-footer">
						<img class="logo-img" src="https://acervofundiario.incra.gov.br/acervo/logo-incra.png" alt="Certifica&ccedil" title="Certifica&ccedil">
						<div class="logo-text">
							<h3>INCRA</h3>
						</div>
					</div>
				</footer>
			</div>
			<!-- Modal Contato -->
			<!-- Modal Sobre -->
			<script src="./Acervo - Login_files/popper.min.js.download" integrity="sha384-zYPOMqeu1DAVkHiLqWBUTcbYfZ8osu1Nd6Z89ify25QV9guujx43ITvfi12/QExE" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
			<script src="./Acervo - Login_files/bootstrap.min.js.download" integrity="sha384-Y4oOpwW3duJdCWv5ly8SCFYWqFDsfob/3GkgExXKV4idmbt98QcxXYs9UoXAB7BZ" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
		</body>
		</html>
